  "bio": "Atelier Nomad Tattoo in Paris, France, is an inclusive sanctuary for body art enthusiasts, welcoming all bodies and genders with open arms. Specializing in exquisite black & gray, intricate fineline, and vibrant floral designs, their diverse team of artists—@la_pygmee, @marviinked, @une_lubie_tattoo, @tess_piercing, @poissons.ttt, and @transcendance.tattoo—transforms skin into a canvas of personal expression. Embrace the artistry in an ambiance that celebrates diversity and creativity.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Paris, Ile-de-france, France\n\nSalon tatouage queer & féministe 🌈\nSalon définitivement fermé \n⚡Flash & sur-mesure \n💉 Tattoo post-opératoire",
